                                                "sense_id": "1662df56-7a8b-3701-aaec-bbe7abc72e1f",
                                                "text": "Over time, the concern is that the cafe’s role as the heart of Parisian society will become obsolete, Mr. Fontaine said, as the younger generation turns to the coffee shop."
